    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One fateful day, our protagonist chanced upon a strange cat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A stray cat with a beautiful lavender coat and an empty stomach.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our protagonist decided to share the rice ball he was holding with the cat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The next day, he woke up to find...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A girl with cat ears sleeping blissfully under the same blanket as him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The girl, Nekomata Okayu, tells him she has nowhere to go, and so they begin living together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the introduction of the mysterious Okayu, our protagonist's uneventful life will never be the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What secrets does Okayu hold? How will their relationship develop? This is a story about the budding bond between the two\u2014more than friends but less than lovers\u2014as they tackle life, sharing both tears and laughter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a heartwarming story about living with Nekomata Okayu!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625380/extras/5d6892ede25248c606a8af506fe008b0.avif?t=1755140302\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADV with a fully-voiced storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the rich story that branches off from one chapter to the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left click/Enter - Next page</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click/Space - Hide window</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl - Skip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AUTO, SAVE, and other buttons - Left-click to operate according to button</p>",
